    "text": "<p>In plotting stress versus strain curves for two materials <math><mi>P</mi></math> and <math><mi>Q</mi></math> , a student by mistake puts strain on the <math><mi>y</mi></math> -axis and stress on the <math><mi>x</mi></math> - axis as shown in the figure. Then the correct statement(s) is(are)<br ><br/><img src=\"assets\\qt0002_081715dfc053.jpg\"/></p>"
  },
